  "display_title": "Lady Adelyn the Homebody",
  "description": "After waking up to find herself as the extraverted side character in the failed novel she co-wrote with a friend, introverted Adelyn is not looking to get involved in anything, including the characters' story. In fact, she plans to stay home and out of everything for as long as she can. But something about the story feels off and won't let her be! With the characters acting out of character and the plot taking twists and turns, will Adelyn be able to get back to her homebody life?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
